{"3681010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nioh 3", "steam_appid": 3681010, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [4003930, 4003950], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition Content</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/951a9270c457592a9c247ad4d0bd6ef2.avif?t=1772090941\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>This edition includes the following content:<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; base game<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; season pass<br>- &quot;Nioh 3&quot; season pass bonus &quot;Chijiko Netsuke Charm&quot; (accessory)<br><br>Digital Deluxe Edition bonus:<br>- Infernal Weapons Set (14 types)<br>- Kodama Netsuke Charm (accessory)<br><br>Note:<br>- The season pass is a set including add-on DLC. The DLC include new stories, enemies, yokai, boss characters, and equipment.<br>- The player must progress to certain points in game to make the season pass content available.<br>- Please be aware that bonuses may become available for purchase or for free as add-on content for this title at a later date. <br>- The details and release dates of content may change without notice.<br>- The season pass bonus will be released on the same date as the base game. Add-on DLC 1 is set to become available by the end of September 2026, and add-on DLC 2 is set to become available by the end of February 2027.<br><br>Please see the official site for more details.<br><br>- The standard edition of &quot;Nioh 3&quot; is also being sold. Please confirm that you have selected the correct product before making your purchase.<br>- The base game and season pass are included in this product. Please be careful not to make duplicate purchases.</p><br><h1>Nioh 3 Demo</h1><p>Conquer the Crucible, Become Shogun<br><br>In the demo version of Nioh 3, the third entry in the dark samurai action RPG series, you can enjoy the beginning of the protagonist's journey. Save data from the demo can be carried over to the final release version of the game.<br><br>Notes:<br>- Nioh 3 Demo is only available for online use and cannot be played offline.<br>- Distribution of the demo may end without prior notice. Please see the official homepage for details.<br>- Players who are able to complete the demo by February 15, 2026, will be gifted the item Twin-Snake Helmet for use in the final release version of the game. This completion bonus is the same as the completion bonus for the PlayStation®5 version of the Alpha Demo.<br>- Demo save data will be automatically carried over upon launching the full game. (The demo save data must be saved on the same device used to play the full game.)<br>- If the full game is started even once and save data is created, you will no longer be able to play the demo.<br>- The demo completion bonus Twin-Snake Helmet, which can be obtained upon completing the demo by February 15, 2026, can also be obtained as a guaranteed item drop upon defeating Jakotsu-baba in the full game by February 15, 2026. Starting February 16, 2026, the item will become a rare drop from Jakotsu-baba.<br>- In order to carry over save data from this demo to the final release version of the game, you must play the final release version on the same console where the demo data is saved, and you must also use the same Steam account when playing the demo and final release versions.</p><br><h1>Steam Version System Requirements for High/Very High Versions</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/84cd5338efed92c2313817e523439471.avif?t=1772090941\" width=1560 height=1190 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Conquer the Crucible, Become Shogun</strong><br><br>Nioh 3 is the eagerly anticipated continuation of the dark samurai action RPG series Nioh. A deadly struggle unfolds amidst the devastation of an alternate Warring States period where bandits run rampant and yokai skulk about.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Elements of the Game:<br>• An open field that challenges you to the fullest</h2>This game features an open field filled with the sense of tension characteristic of the &quot;Nioh&quot; series while also allowing you to explore to your heart's content. In this dark samurai world, you will encounter formidable yokai, explore menacing villages where darkness lurks, and struggle against the ominous presence of &quot;the Crucible.&quot;<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/ee1219833128ef2dfe77b7c0b54b1787.poster.avif?t=1772090941\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/ee1219833128ef2dfe77b7c0b54b1787.webm?t=1772090941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/ee1219833128ef2dfe77b7c0b54b1787.mp4?t=1772090941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/2b9d0539ba1949e14e40a618eb6fa73e.avif?t=1772090941\" width=780 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Samurai and Ninja combat styles</h2>You can enjoy an instantaneous and seamless switch between two combat styles during battle, facing your enemies head-on with Samurai Style and using quick movements and special techniques with Ninja Style.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681010/extras/eb77da2203df648c82feddd7396c47de.poster.avif?t=1772090941\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com